  <div>
    <p>
      Greetings traveler. I'm <a href="/about">Dan</a>, High Warden of this
      domain.
    </p>

    <p>
      In ages past, I soared through the heavens astride great metal dragons.
      But in 2012 another magic called to me: the ancient art of software
      crafting.
    </p>

    <p>
      I now serve the legendary builders of{" "}
      <a href="https://www.framer.com/">Framer</a>{" "}
      from my Fortress of Contemplation. As Battlemage of the Backend Voids, I wield
      arcane spells and command vast armies of immortal Gophers to{" "}
      <b>SHAPE THE DIGITAL AETHER TO MY WILL!</b>
    </p>
  </div>

  <Banner>Maniacal laughter echoes through the load balancers...</Banner>

