  <div>
    <p>
      But that is not all. I also practice the dark arts of Pastromancy: fueled
      by dough, I feast on cinnamon buns to make my power (and waistline) grow!
    </p>

    <p>
      When I'm not keeping the digital aether online (or resisting the baked
      temptations of evil), you will find me lost in tomes of epic adventure or
      wandering the countryside beyond my keep.
    </p>
  </div>

  <Banner>
    Go forth and explore Dan&apos;s Land:
    <br /><br />
    May your caches stay warm when nights grow cold,<br />
    your path remain bug-free,<br />
    and your uptime boast as many nines as the eye can see.
  </Banner>

